<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Static Sites | Kaisheng Song</title><link>https://kshsong.github.io/tags/static-sites/</link><atom:link href="https://kshsong.github.io/tags/static-sites/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><description>Static Sites</description><generator>Hugo Blox Builder (https://hugoblox.com)</generator><language>en-US</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 23 Dec 2025 14:00:00 +0800</lastBuildDate><image><url>https://kshsong.github.io/media/icon_hu_645fa481986063ef.png</url><title>Static Sites</title><link>https://kshsong.github.io/tags/static-sites/</link></image><item><title>How to Build a Personal Blog with Hugo</title><link>https://kshsong.github.io/post/2025/hugo-blog-setup/</link><pubDate>Tue, 23 Dec 2025 14:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://kshsong.github.io/post/2025/hugo-blog-setup/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="how-to-build-a-personal-blog-with-hugo">How to Build a Personal Blog with Hugo&lt;/h1>
&lt;p>This tutorial walks through building a modern personal blog with the Hugo framework.&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="prerequisites">Prerequisites&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>Before you start, make sure you have installed:&lt;/p>
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>
&lt;/li>
&lt;li>
(version 0.115.0 or newer)&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
&lt;h2 id="step-1-create-a-hugo-site">Step 1: Create a Hugo site&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>First, create a new Hugo site:&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">hugo new site my-blog
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nb">cd&lt;/span> my-blog
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;h2 id="step-2-initialize-the-git-repository">Step 2: Initialize the Git repository&lt;/h2>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">git init
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">git add .
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">git commit -m &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;Initial commit&amp;#34;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;h2 id="step-3-add-the-theme">Step 3: Add the theme&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>This blog uses the Academic CV theme from Hugo Blox Builder:&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1"># Add the theme module&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">hugo mod init github.com/username/my-blog
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;p>Then configure &lt;code>config/_default/module.yaml&lt;/code>:&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-yaml" data-lang="yaml">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nt">imports&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>- &lt;span class="nt">path&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="l">github.com/HugoBlox/hugo-blox-builder/starters/academic-cv&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;h2 id="step-4-configure-the-site">Step 4: Configure the site&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>Edit &lt;code>config/_default/hugo.yaml&lt;/code>:&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-yaml" data-lang="yaml">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nt">baseURL&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;https://yourusername.github.io&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="w">&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nt">languageCode&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;en-us&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="w">&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nt">title&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;Your Blog Name&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;h2 id="step-5-create-content">Step 5: Create content&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>Create your first post:&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">hugo new post/my-first-post.md
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;h2 id="step-6-preview-locally">Step 6: Preview locally&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>Start the local server:&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">hugo server -D
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;p>Then visit &lt;code>http://localhost:1313&lt;/code> to see the result.&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="step-7-deploy-to-github-pages">Step 7: Deploy to GitHub Pages&lt;/h2>
&lt;ol>
&lt;li>Create a &lt;code>username.github.io&lt;/code> repository on GitHub&lt;/li>
&lt;li>Configure a GitHub Actions workflow&lt;/li>
&lt;li>Push the code for automatic deployment&lt;/li>
&lt;/ol>
&lt;h2 id="advanced-configuration">Advanced configuration&lt;/h2>
&lt;h3 id="enable-chinese-language-support">Enable Chinese language support&lt;/h3>
&lt;p>Add the following to &lt;code>config/_default/hugo.yaml&lt;/code>:&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-yaml" data-lang="yaml">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nt">hasCJKLanguage&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="kc">true&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;h3 id="custom-styles">Custom styles&lt;/h3>
&lt;p>Create a custom stylesheet in the &lt;code>assets/scss/&lt;/code> directory.&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="summary">Summary&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>Hugo offers a powerful and efficient way to build a blog. With sensible configuration, you can set up a professional personal blog that is easy to maintain.&lt;/p>
&lt;hr>
